      <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; color: #4B5A6E;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color: #0A3D3A; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">→</span> Couples coordinating Social Security strategies who need to model two different FRA dates and benefit amounts.</li>
      <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; color: #4B5A6E;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color: #0A3D3A; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">→</span> Retirees who already filed and want to understand whether their decision was financially optimal over their expected lifespan.</li>
