          <tr style="background: #fff;"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#0D2137;vertical-align:top;">SSA Retirement Planner — Full Retirement Age</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#0D2137;vertical-align:top;">Full Retirement Age by birth year chart used to calculate each user's FRA</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;vertical-align:top;"><a href="https://www.ssa.gov/benefits/retirement/planner/ageincrease.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0A3D3A;text-decoration:underline;">SSA Full Retirement Age Chart</a></td></tr>
